<figure id="Sx3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Sx3.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="Sx3.T2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance comparison among three categories of VLMs (Proprietary, General-purpose, and Medical) on medical text benchmarks. Within each open-source subgroup, <span id="Sx3.T2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> and <span id="Sx3.T2.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underline</span> scores indicate the best and second-best methods, respectively. Note that MedQA, MedXQA, and SGPQA denote MedQA-USMLE, MedXpertQA-Text, and SuperGPQA-Medical benchmarks, respectively.</span></figcaption>
